 ## D. Controller/view guards and generation
-Expose read-only `_offer_forecast(index:Variant,generation:Variant,replace_slot:Variant=-1)->Dictionary`. It returns the same failure shape before pure projection when: non-int index/generation or invalid index -> `Offer unavailable`; state!=shop or generation mismatch -> `Shop view expired`; sold -> `Offer already sold`; matching reservation invalid -> `Reserved offer unavailable: ` + Reservation.invalid_reason. Check this ordering as written. Otherwise pure project with real catalog price; held price is an identity constraint, not an override. Weapon_temper invalidity is rejected by Rules.transaction, so no projection accepts a purchase real authority would refuse.
